OL,3,GNEWSAThe Piano winner driven to prove
OL,4,Ashe could do it
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs a child Grace Matthews loved nothing
OL,7,Fmore than playing her miniature pink
OL,8,Fpiano.
OL,10,FAnd her passion for music only
OL,11,Fintensified as she overcame the
OL,12,Fchallenges of having her fingers
OL,13,Famputated after contracting meningitis
OL,14,Fwhen only four years old.
OL,16,FToday the 19-year-old from Norwich is
OL,17,Fknown to millions after winning Channel
OL,18,F4's The Piano show 15 years after she
OL,19,Fcontracted meningitis and meningococcal
OL,20,Fsepticaemia, conditions which also
OL,21,Fresulted in her lower legs being
OL,22,Famputated.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
