OL,3,GNEWSAThe Piano winner driven to prove
OL,4,Ashe could do it
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I've never really thought to pursue it
OL,7,Fas a career or The Piano show. I think,
OL,8,Ffor me, it was more just to prove that
OL,9,FI can do it," she said.
